        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0007-l0002"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0007-l0002",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0007-l0003"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0007-l0003",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0007-l0004"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0007-l0004",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0007-l0005"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0007-l0005",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0007-l0006"
      },
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0007-l0006",
        "operation": "line_wrap_to_space",
        "right": "p0001-n0007-l0007"
      }
    ],
    "section_id": "s0003",
    "source_line_ids": [
      "p0001-n0007-l0000",
      "p0001-n0007-l0001",
      "p0001-n0007-l0002",
      "p0001-n0007-l0003",
      "p0001-n0007-l0004",
      "p0001-n0007-l0005",
      "p0001-n0007-l0006",
      "p0001-n0007-l0007"
    ],
    "source_pages": [
      1
    ],
    "text": "We make the Visitor Emergency Evacuation(VEE) model to design the evacuation plan. The first model of the emergency evacuation plan is based on an improved ant colony optimization algorithm. The model transforms the entire Louvre into a topological map and influences the selection probability by setting the pheromone concentration threshold to determine the optimal evacuation route for visitors to leave from each region. We also established an evacuation time model and found that the shortest evacuation time for the largest number of visitors in the library was 417.2 s. This result indicates that our evacuation plan is reliable."
  },
  {
    "block_id": "b000012",
    "issues": [],
    "kind": "prose",
    "repairs": [
      {
        "left": "p0001-n0008-l0000",
